- [ ] Gradient Boosting Regression

### 2. Classification

Classification algorithms are used to predict discrete categories or class labels.

Algorithms to be explored:

- [ ] Logistic Regression
- [ ] K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)
- [ ] Decision Tree Classification
- [ ] Random Forest Classification
- [ ] Support Vector Machine (SVM)
- [ ] Naive Bayes
- [ ] Gradient Boosting
- [ ] AdaBoost
- [ ] XGBoost

